{"info": {"address1": "K P Platina", "address2": "9th Floor Race Course", "city": "Vadodara", "zip": "390007", "country": "India", "phone": "91 26 5616 0100", "fax": "91 26 5234 1449", "website": "https://www.inoxcva.com", "industry": "Specialty Industrial Machinery", "industryKey": "specialty-industrial-machinery", "industryDisp": "Specialty Industrial Machinery", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "INOX India Limited manufactures and supplies cryogenic liquid storage and transport tanks for gas companies and engineering, procurement, and construction (EPC) companies in India and internationally. It also offers industrial gas equipment comprising storage and transport tanks, microbulk units, vaporizers and piping, and oil and gas equipment. In addition, the company provides liquid nitrogen containers, bio-series containers, and low-pressure storage tanks; cylinders for gases, including refrigerants, LPG, and helium balloon cylinders. Further, it offers cryogenic process technologies, cryogenic propulsion systems, and satellite and launch facilities, as well as fusion (ITER) and superconductivity. Additionally, the company engages in the installation of equipment and systems for cryogenic conditions, standard cryogenic tanks and equipment, bespoke technology, equipment and solutions, as well as the operation of projects used in industrial gases, LNG, green hydrogen, energy, steel, medical and healthcare, chemicals and fertilizers, aviation and aerospace, construction, and pharmaceuticals. Furthermore, it provides industrial applications, LNG infrastructure, horsepower, automotive industry applications systems, and LNG equipment, as well as beer kegs. The company serves aviation and aerospace, construction and cement, cryo scientific research, dairy and livestock, electronics, fertilizer and chemical, food and beverages, material handling, glass and ceramics, health care and life sciences, hydrogen, industrial gas, LNG and LCNG, metal processing, oil and gas, refining, petrochemical, paper and pulp, pharmaceuticals, power and utilities, rubber, steel and mining, water and water treatment, and entertainment and event sectors. INOX India Limited was incorporated in 1976 and is headquartered in Vadodara, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Deepak V. Acharya", "age": 62, "title": "Chief Executive Officer", "yearBorn": 1963, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Pavan  Logar", "age": 60, "title": "Chief Financial Officer", "yearBorn": 1965, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Jaymeen Mohanbhai Patel", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Parag P. Kulkarni", "age": 75, "title": "Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1950, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 8286000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Tushar  Zope", "title": "Chief Technology Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sudhir  Sethi", "title": "Chief People Officer and Head of HR & Legal", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Savir  Julka", "age": 58, "title": "Global Head of Sales & Marketing for Industrial Gases", "yearBorn": 1967, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vijay  Kalaria", "title": "Global Head of Sales & Marketing for LNG", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. R. L. Panjwani", "title": "President of Cryoscientific Division", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. A. K. Niyogi", "age": 77, "title": "Vice President of Engineering", "yearBorn": 1948, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "